# No Tests Policy

- Do not create new test files.
- Do not modify existing test files.
- Do not run test commands (unit, integration, e2e, or DB-writing tests).
- Skip proposing test execution as a default next step.
- Only perform any test-related action if the user explicitly asks for it in that message.
